error[output.manifest.invalid]: the earlier build's manifest .ink/out/.ink-manifest.json does not parse
  caused by
  `- invalid type: map, expected unit at line 1 column 0
  fix: build into an empty folder with `-o`, or remove .ink/out/.ink-manifest.json yourself
  nothing was changed
error[output.file.unwritable]: .ink/out/index.html could not be written
  caused by
  `- no space left
  fix: check that the folder is writable and has room, then run the command again
  `.ink/out/index.html` may be partly written
error[decision.code.unknown]: no decision has that code
  caused by
  `- `page.titel` is no decision code
  fix: `ink explain` lists every decision of the site with its code
  nothing was changed
error[cli.usage]: unexpected argument `--wy` found
  fix: to pass `--wy` as a value, use `-- --wy`
  nothing was changed

